
   Vaşak Linux — Live Environment
   ==============================

   Install:   vasak-install
   Package:   vpm -Syu          (pacman wrapper)
   Desktop:   systemctl start lightdm   (xfce / vasak ISOs)
              vasak-session             (Vaşak DE from tty, labwc)

   Root login has no password on the live medium.

